      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm coaching a high school debate team and we're doing a round on Universal Basic Income (UBI). I need to help my student prepare for the opposition. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and provide the most devastating rebuttals possible so they can win the debate?",
